{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putt It In Orbit is a putt-tastic adventure through galaxies with different inhabitants and environments. Putt the ball hard to launch it into orbit and see if you can chip it into the hole. This game features tracks with multiple options for reaching the hole\u2014plan by rotating the planet to strategize the best way to putt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Galaxies!</strong>\u00a03 themed galaxies and more to come. Can you find all the secrets hidden in  these worlds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.poster.avif?t=1749593610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.webm?t=1749593610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/542b1e654af2b39985160021f0913c8c.mp4?t=1749593610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate to Explore!</strong>\u00a0With controls to help you explore and find the most optimal path to the hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.poster.avif?t=1749593610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b9789b65e092675bf734ed1.webm?t=1749593610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796570/extras/459f9b524b